<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-ZABEL WINS TOUR DE FRANCE EIGHTH STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ZABEL WINS TOUR DE FRANCE EIGHTH STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>PAU, France 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Erik Zabel won the 161.5-km eighth stage of the Tour de France from Bordeaux to Pau on Sunday.</p>
<p>Frenchman Cedric Vasseur retained the overall lead.</p>
